#: scenario4:scenario4_080B2007_53A6_4FE7_BD90_F4AAD1AF51DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08b20c81e06bf76132445018f105e14abcb20b3042b58fdb08efee8feb2eaa9f
#. default-sha256: 96a1e2bd85ba3188cbaddfa50f5a2a3209a013d179a23206d6049347f40708c9
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_080B2007_53A6_4FE7_BD90_F4AAD1AF51DF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫His was a power that evoked images of witches or demons—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"the unclean and the impure."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Il avait un pouvoir qui évoquait les sorcières et les démons—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫la souillure et l’impureté."

#: scenario4:scenario4_FE12BF3C_FFEF_4F7E_920D_8D5597E9854C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea9466dbd911d12417cc86ad241b2fb322582a23480f22164d161c77c900334f
#. default-sha256: 89c2ac77bf18cadd87c8560d13ca7b41173910b06bf2224953be0f56fca73eee
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FE12BF3C_FFEF_4F7E_920D_8D5597E9854C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A mere touch was all it took for him to strip man and beast alike of its life."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Il lui suffisait d’un simple contact pour dépouiller hommes et bêtes de toute vie."

#: scenario4:scenario4_86AC2019_95A5_471D_A9E3_D12F70D216F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5a75007fb4429d9970021d937ca787e7d1f362997e5aaee0103728720f337d50
#. default-sha256: 94e2ed18ed00b74358790eb28a177f4a7060cffa38ce38cb34f70340303e8a1b
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_86AC2019_95A5_471D_A9E3_D12F70D216F1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫God has quite a cruel streak to bestow such a power upon such a beautiful young man."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dieu doit être bien cruel pour attribuer une telle malédiction à un si beau jeune homme."

#: scenario4:scenario4_597AFB6B_813A_4B73_89CA_D340BFCED63F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a33f824ec6cbef604ada97aafd9efe595d7e67b9f5d3ea6f1e7da7925d113f24
#. default-sha256: 975fd831b04eb4a98bbdeafa224fe36fc5b433aa7ff1ddf7dd81fa3b12c74e1f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_597AFB6B_813A_4B73_89CA_D340BFCED63F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And a strange power it was indeed—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫like something out of a fairy tale."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’était en effet une capacité très particulière—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ qui semblait tout droit sortie "
"d’un conte de fées."

#: scenario4:scenario4_9098F8C1_3796_4C8A_B2F5_0370866CB13B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5edee8b912967ae1967a4b1a4cb9467475f23b311167d0f25dc7208b54200d76
#. default-sha256: 2578620c4283aba60a4d5eb51b40be305ccff53971d133340c1f496763e52361
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_9098F8C1_3796_4C8A_B2F5_0370866CB13B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Like something confined to words upon the page, it seemed otherworldly—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"unbelievable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Comme un univers sorti d’un roman, elle semblait venue d’un autre monde—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ "
"incroyable."

#: scenario4:scenario4_32A3BC75_E658_4EBF_9EC9_03A66D122768
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 75ade004d8a782cc4b08ace8b7b3a9893716882c3f7d057c729a91e5b2b6c8c2
#. default-sha256: 4596982e0ba11e475b42b01a21ad9ce99d3c43756d0a6f3fff1f31a436a24cc3
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_32A3BC75_E658_4EBF_9EC9_03A66D122768"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nonetheless, as he had demonstrated to the White-Haired Girl,⟪k:1⟫his peculiar powers were "
"indeed real."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pourtant, comme il en avait fait la démonstration à la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs, ses "
"étranges pouvoirs étaient bien réels."

#: scenario4:scenario4_100746D0_4882_4A6C_9891_2AB1CB04E750
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6ba65db83c4822e265ed93dd980639a8ac88ad4da3554ca102198dcff6a84ad3
#. default-sha256: 369e5fcee061d26aa795bc6c764e80e344d8ddce3c37bb7f77247efc49791af9
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_100746D0_4882_4A6C_9891_2AB1CB04E750"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That said, the world has its fair share of oddities—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Cela dit, le monde a son lot de bizarreries—"

#: scenario4:scenario4_0BD2FA9E_A735_4A4A_B086_D5F56F5DCA58
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aae351ad753494e5d001bd2f5a0e686d98ff63829e3f5d50660680e6d546457a
#. default-sha256: 0dac29b808b1c0a425e6372d788a0b3375a917ab560ec7dfb70eeb54f7095b24
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_0BD2FA9E_A735_4A4A_B086_D5F56F5DCA58"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫it just so happens that those curiosities tend to remain hidden away, known only to a few."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫il se trouve simplement que ces anomalies tendent à rester cachées, connues seulement d’un "
"petit nombre."

#: scenario4:scenario4_A7C64CA8_D0DC_4929_B370_35086EB52112
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c09c84c8ad0a93f75f63e830408ad0eabd92cb0c706970d676270c3cfcb3a758
#. default-sha256: 696c4930c3a82ab59eb500f77a30e9c53eb33b9419e1e4babe5b5c6a8cffa245
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A7C64CA8_D0DC_4929_B370_35086EB52112"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Hehe... ⟪k:1⟫Although, you have laid eyes upon a number of unusual phenomena yourself, "
"Master."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Héhé... ⟪k:1⟫Vous-même, vous avez pu voir de nombreux phénomènes inhabituels, Maître."

#: scenario4:scenario4_DDF71E19_07F1_4BEF_B6BA_100C84D6A6F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f0beed424f7cec77b728a5488ef74620e5e12d54b2900a5d19e5e7ba49228f8d
#. default-sha256: 2cd50e979101bfc0465c53fc1f2895f62cbb8f90e0248d42bf802aa737c6ddbc
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_DDF71E19_07F1_4BEF_B6BA_100C84D6A6F1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The doors to the past through which we have passed.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫This very mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Les portes du passé que vous avez traversées.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ce manoir lui-même."

#: scenario4:scenario4_A8A0F831_78C5_4AC6_96C6_38E7C8EF891F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c5dfb90036046a471667d342550992800100ef152a97335d4d16c8c79c5cbdda
#. default-sha256: e352923c93c191604fb6f51d3fb64f4b1e57e5082b69be19d8eac78acf696f77
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A8A0F831_78C5_4AC6_96C6_38E7C8EF891F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And, as a matter of fact, the two of us."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ainsi que nous deux, d’ailleurs."

#: scenario4:scenario4_915E76E1_FB5E_422E_AA7F_BD2522DB5BE4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a0c66d40fb7d3982f44cc4e395ee9bc1681ad512f54f90d4e790ac9d7b62c6a5
#. default-sha256: 8e2ed74263e6d44ad6ed1687d4091276d748d951c3b2447c1a1b1e35c4b6ff2f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_915E76E1_FB5E_422E_AA7F_BD2522DB5BE4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Now, as you just saw, the White-Haired Girl found herself enraptured with this man and his "
"accursed power."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫À⟪k:2⟫ présent, comme vous venez de le voir, la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs était "
"émerveillée par cet homme et son maudit pouvoir."

#: scenario4:scenario4_446CC45D_0D41_45FF_8AC6_F9723AEDE98F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4d6ac1dc58db948c3c0f0025594e00024d1a958f914cbbdda4123adb70495f3c
#. default-sha256: 786270e69fcc490ffffc648af49f4520b01ce8be40d4c0732a81c3cdab7c5c68
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_446CC45D_0D41_45FF_8AC6_F9723AEDE98F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫How do you think Michel acted in response to her proclamation?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫À⟪k:2⟫ votre avis, comment Michel réagit-il à sa déclaration ?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_70B6DA8E_A300_4F18_93EA_9079A9144F3C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a19ccf6dc837140fe265508120c2772274ce0cf7e89417ea507003c905454cb
#. default-sha256: 932b9a90306cb9574ff77988f7d4ca6f96a0ff1f1850aa98a6387a113f77019d
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_70B6DA8E_A300_4F18_93EA_9079A9144F3C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He had spent so long refusing to interact with others—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫no, ⟪k:3⟫unable⟪k:4⟫ to "
"interact with them. ⟪k:5⟫As such, he was unsure how to respond."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il avait passé tant de temps à refuser d’interagir avec les autres—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ non, il était "
"⟪k:3⟫incapable⟪k:4⟫ d’interagir avec eux. ⟪k:5⟫Et donc, il ne savait quoi répondre."

#: scenario4:scenario4_8EF2143C_B757_414D_AB1D_74DA9556FC56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1a65273b9fa32f7ceaa247792539b8436c5140c073e8bf059f8c4596c8fa0bbd
#. default-sha256: 1ac17b8c65812ed9bff3c953bbc36c1b1b9c28eb2574e578ad13d388ac8755cc
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_8EF2143C_B757_414D_AB1D_74DA9556FC56"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫After standing there expressionless for a few moments, he muttered,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Il resta immobile, sans expression, pendant quelques instants, puis il murmura :"

#: scenario4:scenario4_CD55C3F8_A905_4230_AD11_110D456B5E9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8c0657f4dbe1c7c83eb2c557d651268c8cee8c7ebc0263aae45f22a94cc96853
#. default-sha256: a1d6dff7a19d730642c4041f208d42feb2e50724afc5dbb4f6c3eb8a4f03b4dc
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_CD55C3F8_A905_4230_AD11_110D456B5E9B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’ll consider it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je vais y réfléchir."

#: scenario4:scenario4_736BAF79_427A_4E66_B723_722488B5F776
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3b423de05e7f1bac88dba80462b5b50276560e6dac4f7b63a0023c5fde952a0e
#. default-sha256: 82ff9dbb5240502c5086a7757de232ba7a005f3e9923ed6752ac9e88d0a98520
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_736BAF79_427A_4E66_B723_722488B5F776"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And with that, he returned to his chambers."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Sur ce, il retourna dans ses appartements."

#: scenario4:scenario4_527E3E63_6525_4BB5_98A7_2D237A0BFD96
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cbaab5f1b2acae9ee50454adf18501f91604108b5f591e185310e936f27e176a
#. default-sha256: ef6a5443b95b8498787114a5ff9b17e3484ef05f3735ba9f59acee1aa4df97e7
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_527E3E63_6525_4BB5_98A7_2D237A0BFD96"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫While he was not someone who wore his heart on his sleeve,⟪k:1⟫I personally do not believe "
"he was completely devoid of emotions."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Certes, il n’était pas très expansif, mais personnellement, je ne crois pas qu’il ait été "
"totalement dénué d’émotions."

#: scenario4:scenario4_32F6F341_FDAA_448E_9958_F339D58F7B6A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a4ae78ebe393396c15c98f8b4e6d729d3c7cd8ed0c66bd0955961c7d36637fcb
#. default-sha256: 8c261a6f0da3616b1a5be9207ce192e695e8728b993dd33f0c657af334bbb59c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_32F6F341_FDAA_448E_9958_F339D58F7B6A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He had simply forgotten how to express them in his extended solitude."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Il avait simplement oublié la façon de les exprimer, dans sa longue solitude."

#: scenario4:scenario4_790071D5_5A70_46AA_9375_6BD9F3292563
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e4f6a548950272cf945d9ad91892db3aceef9be189db4489f657c5e17854bfc4
#. default-sha256: 5fba2f82cb2f3725b87dd3fefd80f3316167c8342e357ecc3023b08b48a91c52
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_790071D5_5A70_46AA_9375_6BD9F3292563"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So I think he was, in that moment, in a state of complete panic."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Donc, je pense qu’il était, à ce moment-là, dans un état de panique totale."

#: scenario4:scenario4_FC33860C_4C15_40F4_A6E3_1E3C08EB113C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 466c89e57fb0930ab8a449cf086b05d818f0fe6e1dc08c66d5c1e3b10f441e50
#. default-sha256: a8c00f1ebdff8ff14c3b4cd872908a94e171b6af3c6bee7b7926d1f610fb5702
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FC33860C_4C15_40F4_A6E3_1E3C08EB113C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She had, after all, just assaulted him with a stream of incomprehensible declarations:"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Elle l’avait, après tout, assailli d’un flot de déclarations incompréhensibles,"

#: scenario4:scenario4_E5D92A94_F292_4C2C_8D9D_8443D5D2B311
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e60545d4f45208af34c3859f2de2680e474bdc2a7fc538acf7df257df14af810
#. default-sha256: a7f40870bd39c3922849978ff21d9119e41154059f91988ba99c0039cc14cd3c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E5D92A94_F292_4C2C_8D9D_8443D5D2B311"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫that, knowing the truth, she still wished to remain in the mansion..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫en disant que, même en sachant la vérité, elle souhaitait rester au manoir..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_16200131_11A1_4A98_9983_68F65BACF567
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a268bb4f00c95db988e393d8b3383ef4578b5d5d2b8b5ab8b444316d0647fa0c
#. default-sha256: 6e5ce635d6d55d1d121963064fff333c510db176d7c7be0a498f49c6cf9c7771
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_16200131_11A1_4A98_9983_68F65BACF567"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and that, knowing the truth, she loved him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...et que, même en sachant la vérité, elle l’aimait."

#: scenario4:scenario4_8756CEDF_43A7_4F0B_998C_407CA088D4F8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6136790c5a3231040a76a634203a522388c7395bf6e6237366dcb961f96c8bfb
#. default-sha256: aaec3991166686b8b2a08cdd55fddce4f1422ca220535f76d1edc57f8cae99c7
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_8756CEDF_43A7_4F0B_998C_407CA088D4F8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The love she had declared for Michel was not a fleeting puppy love;⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫there was "
"genuine tenderness and warmth to her words."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’amour qu’elle avait déclaré à Michel n’était pas celui de l’inconstante jeunesse ;⟪k:1⟫ "
"ses paroles recélaient une vraie tendresse et une chaleur sincère."

#: scenario4:scenario4_7E93951E_197D_4B67_AACD_D5F879C7EB47
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 34449a96bd18fb3f16f7adaa8b951b5403dc0dfed0590048addc27b4f1c556aa
#. default-sha256: a7c50ef4417e44f769c1cefd2f65c9cacca06305f0ba3d09f73b9157a79f2033
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7E93951E_197D_4B67_AACD_D5F879C7EB47"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But he had gone through his life shunned, feared, pushed away.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫To him, that was "
"normal."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il avait vécu sa vie en étant rejeté, craint, repoussé.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Pour lui, c’était normal."

#: scenario4:scenario4_EA4739AD_440A_4B3E_BD69_6B2C9069D45E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 72560b40e66c843ba96a639b1e26d561b3927f55695398583255766b8905108e
#. default-sha256: 8f19c0fb8c262b84aa0cefcdb7aa7f3e00a99e2b876937caaa2c93571c99708c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_EA4739AD_440A_4B3E_BD69_6B2C9069D45E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He had never given anyone reason to have any fondness for him,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Il n’avait jamais donné à personne de raisons d’éprouver des sentiments à son égard,"

#: scenario4:scenario4_70E19D8A_D718_4F41_8B20_44ACB74FCC60
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 20fc55c08b4c26c9e185eb7316cd496c33e7802c3321bafa4805d8decb2b8b5f
#. default-sha256: 7665c5d0b9bac4fcb03f827fe3887d2f5188478b29cc6d1e8ad4cf05a84fc53c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_70E19D8A_D718_4F41_8B20_44ACB74FCC60"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫so he found himself utterly unsure how to take the affection she was showing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫c’est pourquoi il ne savait absolument pas quoi faire de l’affection qu’elle lui témoignait."

#: scenario4:scenario4_94244513_6F40_479B_846A_CA55E3986713
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 794b61be81ebfb87453391f8488cb188646bfc4cde4d9cec0a2b89c7e52ba348
#. default-sha256: 81705d1e17485f47c0287f14192f2794304b414fcd98eaf57b9b32234e3b65b4
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_94244513_6F40_479B_846A_CA55E3986713"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Of course... ⟪k:1⟫he was not the only one rattled by the whole affair."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Bien sûr... ⟪k:1⟫il n’était pas le seul à être secoué par toute cette affaire."

#: scenario4:scenario4_F2BD1EAC_2F55_47F8_8461_C52B49B7724E
